      "text": "METROBASE Traffic Update as of 7:00PM\n\nWHEN: June 15, 2025\n\nA. MAJOR ROADS:\n\n*EDSA\nSOUTHBOUND\n- Monte De Piedad to Aurora blvd, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Relaince to Guadalupe, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles and Manila Waters Roadwork)\n- Tramo to Taft, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nNORTHBOUND\n- F.B Harrison to Taft, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Ayala to Buendia, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Shaw blvd to Ortigas, slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Balintawak, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*C5\nSOUTHBOUND\n- Xavierville Avenue to Aurora Blvd, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nNORTHBOUND: \n- Green Meadows, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- B. Serrano, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Aurora Katipunan to Miriam, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*COMMONWEALTH\nEASTBOUND:\n- Regalado, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nWESTBOUND:\n- Regalado, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*QUEZON AVENUE\nEASTBOUND:\n- EDSA, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nWESTBOUND:\n- Senator Miriam Defensor Santiago Avenue to EDSA, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Araneta, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*MARCOS HIGHWAY\nEASTBOUND:\n-SM Marikina to Burger king, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nWESTBOUND:\n- Town & Country to Ligaya, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- SM Marikina to Aurora blvd, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*ORTIGAS AVENUE\nEASTBOUND:\n- Santolan, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- GreenMeadows to Rosario, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nWESTBOUND\n- ETON to EDSA, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Greenhills to Santolan, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*ROXAS BOULEVARD\nSOUTHBOUND:\n- Quirino Avenue, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Baclaran to Airport road, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nNORTHBOUND:\n- Padre Burgos, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*TAFT AVENUE\nSOUTHBOUND:\n- Buendia, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nNORTHBOUND:\n- Arnaiz, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Quirino Avenue, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n#mmda",
